---
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";

const title = "Affiliate Disclosure";
---

<LegalLayout
  title={title}
  description="Trusted Buyer Lab affiliate relationships, retailer links, commissions, and how recommendations are presented."
  canonicalPath="/affiliate-disclosure/"
>
  <p>
    Trusted Buyer Lab participates in affiliate advertising programs and may use
    retailer or partner tracking links, including Amazon and PartnerBoost links.
  </p>

  <h2>Amazon Associate disclosure</h2>
  <p>
    As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. When you click a
    retailer or affiliate link and make a purchase, we may receive a commission
    at no additional cost to you.
  </p>

  <h2>How affiliate links affect recommendations</h2>
  <p>
    Affiliate compensation may influence how links are presented, but the goal
    is to organize product information usefully for readers. Product claims,
    prices, and availability should always be verified with the retailer.
  </p>

  <h2>Prices and availability</h2>
  <p>
    Prices and availability are accurate only when displayed by the retailer and
    may change. The price and availability shown at checkout will apply.
  </p>

  <h2>No extra cost</h2>
  <p>
    Using our affiliate links does not increase your purchase price.
    Commissions help support the cost of maintaining this website.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
